Bind Npc 31566 Zone 11 for karus
Bind Npc 31565 Zone 12 for elmorad
Quest 654 "Appraising Specialties"
    Journal for karus "You must accept the request of [Appraiser] Rockus."
    Journal for elmorad "You must accept the request of [Appraiser] Diz"
    Collect 10 of 379006000

Requires player level >= 65 and quest 653 is completed

Rewards
    Give 250000 experience
    Give 20000 coins

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "[Item Appraiser] Lockers is appraising something. Let's go take a look."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "[Item Appraiser] Disney is appraising something. Let's go take a look."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "There you are. Now that you have what I asked you for, shall we start the appraisal?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Well, that's why I need to start the appraisal but I am currently out of [Exid Potion]. Can you bring me a few [Exid Potion] from the [Store]?\n\nStore materials, the amount of seed potions to help the Appraisers of Goods Eslant updated rocker's feelings of purchasing must be followed."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "There you are. Now that you have what I asked you for, shall we start the appraisal?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Well, that's why I need to start the appraisal but I am currently out of [Exid Potion]. Can you bring me a few [Exid Potion] from the [Store]?\n\nStore materials, the amount of seed potions to help the feelings of Appraisers of Goods Eslant updated Deeds purchase must be followed."

On in_progress
    Say "Are you holding a grudge against me? Go get it fast."

On claimable
    If player is karus
        Show quest "So you have it. Well done. Let's start the appraisal.\n\nAnd in the meanwhile, please collect the next item. [First-Class Canine] from [Iron Claws]. It's very precious and tough to get it.  Good luck."
    If player is elmorad
        Show quest "So you have it. Well done. Let's start the appraisal.\n\nAnd in the meantime, please collect the next item. [First-Class Canine] from [Iron Claws]. It's very precious and tough to get it.  Good luck."

On completed
    Say "Then, I will see you when you reach Lv66. You don't have enough skills to collect the following items."
